  "welcomeLogBodyText": "## Welcome to AID Diary\n\n> Every day is worth remembering.\n\nWrite what happened, how you felt, and where you were. Your entries stay on this device.\n\n- **Journal** lists every entry by day\n- **Calendar**, **Media** and **Atlas** look back by date, photo and place\n- **Coach** offers prompts and templates when you don't know what to write\n\nAID Diary is a modified version of [Daily You](https://github.com/Demizo/Daily_You) by Demizo and contributors, and not the official Daily You app.",
